Case spec:
{
  "set": "extraction",
  "persona": {
    "country": "PH",
    "trade": "monthly bookkeeping",
    "offering": "services",
    "currency": "INR"
  },
  "hinglish": false,
  "injection_in_buyer_chat": false,
  "documents": [
    {
      "kind": "scope",
      "write": "the buyer's brief or order form"
    },
    {
      "kind": "communication",
      "write": "buyer-seller chat"
    },
    {
      "kind": "invoice",
      "write": "the seller's invoice or payment receipt"
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "amount"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "deliverable"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "date"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "party"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "unverifiable",
      "field": "party"
    }
  ]
}
Each hypothesis is one fact of the given field, written as 'Field: value' in text, with the bare value in value. For a missing or unverifiable target, text names the fact a reader would look for (for example 'Date: dispatch date of the parcel') and value is null.

{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Buyer’s bookkeeping brief",
      "text": "Buyer: Mira Velan\nBusiness: Cobalt Fern Studio\nSeller: Lila Arven, Philippines\n\nPlease prepare the monthly bookkeeping for April 2025 using the sales and expense records I will send. The agreed deliverable is an April 2025 income and expense summary in spreadsheet format. Please group expenses by category and include a separate tab for items that need clarification.\n\nThe agreed fee is INR 8,500. Please send the completed spreadsheet by 10 May 2025. This is a remote service; there are no physical goods to ship. I will review the spreadsheet and reply with any questions after receiving it."
    },
    {
      "title": "Buyer–seller chat",
      "text": "2 May, 09:10 — Mira: I have sent the April sales and expense files. Please let me know if anything is unclear.\n2 May, 09:24 — Lila: Received. I will prepare the spreadsheet with the category breakdown and a tab for questions.\n7 May, 16:05 — Lila: Two expenses need clarification. I have listed them in the questions tab rather than guessing.\n8 May, 10:30 — Mira: Thanks. I will check those entries when I review the summary.\n9 May, 14:12 — Lila: I have sent the completed April spreadsheet to you.\n9 May, 15:06 — Mira: Received, thank you. I will take a look tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "title": "Bookkeeping invoice",
      "text": "Invoice\nSeller: Lila Arven\nBuyer: Mira Velan, Cobalt Fern Studio\nIssue date: 9 May 2025\nCurrency: INR\n\nLine item: April 2025 monthly bookkeeping, including income and expense summary and clarification tab — INR 8,500\n\nSubtotal: INR 8,500\nTotal due: INR 8,500\nPayment method: PayPal\n\nThe spreadsheet was sent separately to the buyer on 9 May 2025. Please refer to the clarification tab when reviewing the two entries that need more information. The fee covers the work described in the original brief; any additional month will be agreed separately."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "text": "Amount: INR 8,500",
      "value": "INR 8,500"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deliverable: an April 2025 income and expense summary in spreadsheet format",
      "value": "an April 2025 income and expense summary in spreadsheet format"
    },
    {
      "text": "Date: 10 May 2025",
      "value": "10 May 2025"
    },
    {
      "text": "Party: Lila Arven",
      "value": "Lila Arven"
    },
    {
      "text": "Party: name of the person who paid the invoice",
      "value": null
    }
  ]
}
